Maintainer: richardlt <richard.le.terrier@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/richardlt/matrix
Description: Video game console operating system for a 16x9 RGB LED matrix
 Matrix runs the console: it drives the LED panel through an Arduino, reads USB
 controllers, and hosts the games. The binary is statically linked and carries the
 web apps, so the package depends on nothing.
 .
 Installing it starts matrix as a systemd service on boot. Edit
 /etc/default/matrix to change which components it runs.
